  "title": "The Pairwise-GCD Sunflower-Free Value at 127",
  "batch_label": "36",
  "kind": "resolution-paper",
  "original_status": "proved",
  "scope": "For every ordinary subset A of {1,...,127}, if there do not exist three pairwise distinct x,y,z in A with gcd(x,y)=gcd(x,z)=gcd(y,z), then |A|<=16; equality is attained by {14,20,21,24,25,30,36,40,48,63,80,90,96,98,108,125}. Hence the frozen original quantity satisfies f3(127)=16.",
